  "title": "FLUX: A pipeline for MEG analysis",
  "description": "FLUX is a comprehensive pipeline for magnetoencephalography (MEG) data analysis, providing standardized workflows for processing and analyzing MEG recordings. This BIDS-compliant dataset contains raw MEG data from multiple subjects with implemented preprocessing and analysis workflows including source localization, frequency domain analysis, and statistical testing. The dataset demonstrates the application of the FLUX pipeline for neuroimaging analysis, including MEG signal processing, artifact rejection, and brain activity quantification.",
